  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">請閱讀說明以獲取安裝指南</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">關於</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">此光影是基於</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</span></a> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">修改而成，添加了酷炫的視覺效果，最重要的是，實現了</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Mod</a></span><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> 及其光軌之間的兼容性。此光影應與任何使用 Epic Fight 光軌的模組兼容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">照片中使用武器來自模組</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/annoying-villagers-full\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Annoying Villagers: Herobrine Invasion</a></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">安裝指南</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">要安裝此光影，您需要下載包含光影及其配置的壓縮文件。您需要將壓縮文件中的兩個文件複製並粘貼到光影文件夾中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">您的光影文件夾必須包含以下兩項內容：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1345898/description_5dc526f3-2b10-4587-b88a-a743993fbad6.png\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">致謝</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">感謝 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emingt/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EminGT</a> </span>，因為我使用的是他的 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a></span><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> 版本，並添加了用於某些視覺效果的自定義資源以及 Epic Fight Mod 的光軌。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">本包包含所需的原始 Complementary 許可協議。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
